{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33883","headline":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 一 · 皮日休","name":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一方萧洒地，之子独深居。\n绕屋亲栽竹，堆牀手写书。\n高风翔砌鸟，暴雨失池鱼。\n暗识归山计，村边买鹿车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}